{"id":"461322","name":"酸辣羊杂汤","author":"阳台上的草莓","authorId":"7597089","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/461322/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"即食羊杂","amount":"200g"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"枸杞子","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"辣酱","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"醋","amount":"2匙"},{"name":"植物油","amount":"10g"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"盐","amount":"1g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"葱姜切片。","img":"images/461322/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"羊杂用开水焯一遍。","img":"images/461322/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅放油烧热，下葱姜爆香。","img":"images/461322/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入羊杂翻炒片刻。","img":"images/461322/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入辣酱，生抽，枸杞子，水，盐煮5分钟。","img":"images/461322/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"出锅时放入醋，再放一些葱花即可。","img":"images/461322/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"配着缸炉烧饼，完美一餐。","img":"images/461322/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}